dp_clock shows the time on a DisplayPad button.

The appearance of the clock can be configured through the action
associated with the key.
Possible values are:
sec - shows seconds
12h - shows a 12 hour AM/PM clock (default is to show a 24 hour clock)
date - shows the date below the time
These values can be combined with a , symbol (e.g. sec,date)

IF the action value is empty a standard 24 hour clock showing
hour and minues is shown.
